## FAQ
### How do I scan a receipt?
Open **Scan** → **Scan Receipt** (or import from Photos/Files) → review details → **Save**.
### Why can’t I see my receipt image?
Make sure you scanned/imported and then tapped **Save**. The saved receipt will show its image in **Receipts**.
### Exports are not opening on Simulator
On a real device, sharing/export works best. Simulator sharing apps can be limited.
### How do I edit or delete a receipt?
Open **Receipts** → select a receipt → use **Edit** or **Delete**.
You can also swipe-to-delete in the list.
## Troubleshooting
- Restart the app if camera/import permissions were changed.
- Ensure you have at least one saved receipt before exporting.
